      "Columns A-N are AccountingVouchers.xlsx's own 14, unchanged and in order, so a template already keyed against Tally's sample file still lines up on them. Columns O-Y are the Buyer/Supplier (Party Details) block \u2014 every one a field on Tally's own list, and every one on the Mapping Template sheet below. Map ALL of them: an added column left unmapped is what errors the import, not the column itself.",
