      "Layout: Ledger Details from Multiple Rows. One voucher spans several rows \u2014 the first row of each group carries the date, voucher number and party address; the rows under it are its remaining ledger lines and are blank in those columns (reference doc \u00a71.3).",
      null,
      null,
