      "Import the masters workbook first \u2014 the unit of measure is read off the stock item's base unit, and the party ledger has to exist before a voucher can name it. The party's GSTIN, state, registration type and place of supply are on both: the master holds them, and columns O-Y restate them on the voucher so it cannot pick up a half-created party.",
